abstract: "Dot-Trace Theory proposes that persistent, socially accessible interaction traces mediate the co-evolution of agent behavior, memory structure, and social topology. This repository contains synthetic experiment scaffolding, reference simulators, validation runners, reproducibility documentation, and companion materials."
